OL,3,GNEWSACouple killed in crash 'will never
OL,4,Abe forgotten'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple killed in a crash would be
OL,7,F"deeply missed" and "never forgotten",
OL,8,Ftheir family have said.
OL,10,FKeith and Vivienne Scott died after
OL,11,Ftheir silver Vauxhall Corsa crashed
OL,12,Fwith a black Vauxhall Astra on the
OL,13,FB5017 Highwood Road in Netherland
OL,14,FGreen, near Uttoxeter, Staffordshire,
OL,15,Fon 23 October.
OL,17,FVivienne, 71, was the passenger in the
OL,18,FCorsa and was pronounced dead at the
OL,19,Fscene, Staffordshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
